    "body": "**Problem:** When a test expects an RPC error by number, readers have to look up the code to tell which failure it covers.\n\n**Fix:** Use the `RPCErrorCode` names in the C++ RPC tests and mirror the enum in the Python test framework.\nGive the test client’s errors their own constants so `AuthServiceProxy` and `TestNodeCLI` can share the HTTP error code.\n\nI split this out while reviewing #36976.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Compare the original numeric error codes</summary>\n\nRun this diff to inline the constants back to validate that the values haven't changed.\n\n```sh\nsed -Ei -f /dev/stdin $(git diff --name-only HEAD~3 HEAD) <<'SED'\n/^enum RPCErrorCode$/,/^};$/b\ns/\\bRPC_INVALID_REQUEST\\b/-32600/g\ns/\\bRPC_METHOD_NOT_FOUND\\b/-32601/g\ns/\\bRPC_INVALID_PARAMS\\b/-32602/g\ns/\\bRPC_INTERNAL_ERROR\\b/-32603/g\ns/\\bRPC_PARSE_ERROR\\b/-32700/g\ns/\\bRPC_MISC_ERROR\\b/-1/g\ns/\\bRPC_TYPE_ERROR\\b/-3/g\ns/\\bRPC_INVALID_ADDRESS_OR_KEY\\b/-5/g\ns/\\bRPC_OUT_OF_MEMORY\\b/-7/g\ns/\\bRPC_INVALID_PARAMETER\\b/-8/g\ns/\\bRPC_DATABASE_ERROR\\b/-20/g\ns/\\bRPC_DESERIALIZATION_ERROR\\b/-22/g\ns/\\bRPC_VERIFY_ERROR\\b/-25/g\ns/\\bRPC_VERIFY_REJECTED\\b/-26/g\ns/\\bRPC_VERIFY_ALREADY_IN_UTXO_SET\\b/-27/g\ns/\\bRPC_IN_WARMUP\\b/-28/g\ns/\\bRPC_METHOD_DEPRECATED\\b/-32/g\ns/\\bRPC_LIMIT_EXCEEDED\\b/-37/g\ns/\\bRPC_TRANSACTION_ERROR\\b/-25/g\ns/\\bRPC_TRANSACTION_REJECTED\\b/-26/g\ns/\\bRPC_CLIENT_NOT_CONNECTED\\b/-9/g\ns/\\bRPC_CLIENT_IN_INITIAL_DOWNLOAD\\b/-10/g\ns/\\bRPC_CLIENT_NODE_ALREADY_ADDED\\b/-23/g\ns/\\bRPC_CLIENT_NODE_NOT_ADDED\\b/-24/g\ns/\\bRPC_CLIENT_NODE_NOT_CONNECTED\\b/-29/g\ns/\\bRPC_CLIENT_INVALID_IP_OR_SUBNET\\b/-30/g\ns/\\bRPC_CLIENT_P2P_DISABLED\\b/-31/g\ns/\\bRPC_CLIENT_NODE_CAPACITY_REACHED\\b/-34/g\ns/\\bRPC_CLIENT_MEMPOOL_DISABLED\\b/-33/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_ERROR\\b/-4/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS\\b/-6/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_INVALID_LABEL_NAME\\b/-11/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_KEYPOOL_RAN_OUT\\b/-12/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_UNLOCK_NEEDED\\b/-13/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_PASSPHRASE_INCORRECT\\b/-14/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_WRONG_ENC_STATE\\b/-15/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_ENCRYPTION_FAILED\\b/-16/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_ALREADY_UNLOCKED\\b/-17/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_NOT_FOUND\\b/-18/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_NOT_SPECIFIED\\b/-19/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_ALREADY_LOADED\\b/-35/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_ALREADY_EXISTS\\b/-36/g\ns/\\bRPC_WALLET_INVALID_ACCOUNT_NAME\\b/-11/g\ns/\\bRPC_FORBIDDEN_BY_SAFE_MODE\\b/-2/g\ns/\\bRPC_HTTP_ERROR\\b/-342/g\ns/\\bRPC_MISSING_RESULT\\b/-343/g\ns/\\bRPC_TIMEOUT\\b/-344/g\ns/strprintf\\((R\"\\(\\{\"code\":)%d(.*\"), (-[0-9]+)\\)/\\1\\3\\2/\nSED\n\ngit diff HEAD~3\n```\n</details>\n",
