      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### External sites\n\n* Code coverage & benchmarks: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36990\n* Ralph review <img src=https://review.fish.foo/assets/bitcoin/bitcoin/36990.png alt=\"Ralph review status\"> https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36990#author-ralph\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--5faf32d7da4f0f540f40219e4f7537a3-->\n### LLM Linter (✨ experimental)\n\n\n\nPossible places where named args for integral literals may be used (e.g. `func(x, /*named_arg=*/0)` in C++, and `func(x, named_arg=0)` in Python):\n\n- `test/functional/mempool_ephemeral_dust.py`: `prioritisetransaction(dusty_tx[\"txid\"], 0, 1)`\n- `test/functional/mining_prioritisetransaction.py`: `prioritisetransaction(txid, 'foo', 0)`\n- `test/functional/mining_prioritisetransaction.py`: `prioritisetransaction(txid, 1, 0)`\n- `test/functional/p2p_disconnect_ban.py`: `setban(\"127.27.0.1\", \"add\", 123, True)`\n- `test/functional/rpc_packages.py`: `submitpackage(chained_burn_hex, 0, chained_txns_burn[1][\"new_utxo\"][\"value\"] - Decimal(\"0.00000001\"))`\n- `test/functional/rpc_psbt.py`: `walletcreatefundedpsbt([...], {target_address: 1}, 0, {'add_inputs': False})`\n- `test/functional/rpc_psbt.py`: `walletcreatefundedpsbt([...], {target_address: 1}, 0, {'add_inputs': True, 'minconf': 3, 'fee_rate': 10})`\n- `test/functional/rpc_psbt.py`: `walletcreatefundedpsbt([], dest_arg, 0, {\"max_tx_weight\": ...})`\n- `test/functional/rpc_psbt.py`: `walletcreatefundedpsbt([], dest_arg_large, 0, {\"max_tx_weight\": ...})`\n- `test/functional/rpc_psbt.py`: `walletcreatefundedpsbt(inputs, outputs, 0, {param: value, \"add_inputs\": True})`\n- `test/functional/rpc_psbt.py`: `walletcreatefundedpsbt([], [{\"data\": \"deadbeef\"}], 0, {\"fee_rate\": \"0\"})`\n- `test/functional/rpc_rawtransaction.py`: `createrawtransaction, [], {}, 0, False, TX_MIN_STANDARD_VERSION - 1`\n- `test/functional/rpc_rawtransaction.py`: `createrawtransaction, [], {}, 0, False, TX_MAX_STANDARD_VERSION + 1`\n- `test/functional/rpc_rawtransaction.py`: `sendrawtransaction, tx_hex, 0, 0.0009`\n- `test/functional/wallet_send.py`: `w0.send, {w1.getnewaddress(): 1}, 6, \"conservative\", 1, {\"feeRate\": 0.01}`\n\n\n\n<sup>2026-11-26 19:17:04</sup>\n",
